node_modules/
data/*
# the audit snapshots are the whole point of the audit - they are the rollback
# source for the server migration and the diff base for the next audit
!data/server-audit-*.json
!data/server-audit-*.csv
# the effort log's FORMAT is committed; the log itself is not. growth-effort.json
# is hand-kept per deployment, and `npm run review` reports an absent one as
# absent rather than scoring it as zero hours
!data/growth-effort.example.json
backups/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
# TOG-1644 staging demo artifacts. They default to a private runtime directory
# outside the checkout now, but TWO_SESSION_DEMO_* can still point at one and an
# older revision's defaults landed here. Neither the guild's member->role map nor
# a live invite should ever be one `git add -A` away from the remote.
.staging-session-demo-snapshot.json
.staging-session-demo-invite.txt
